  "analysis": "The build failed because the code uses an unstable Rust feature `is_multiple_of`. I need to fix this in the source code by replacing it with a compatible alternative like `write_count % n == 0`.",
  "plan": "1. Check the Rust version\n2. Fix the code in crates/writer/src/lib.rs by replacing is_multiple_of with modulo operator\n3. Rebuild the project",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "rustc --version\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
